OL,3,GNEWSATeen jailed again for
OL,4,Amachete-point Rolex robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who threatened to decapitate
OL,7,FTV presenter Aled Jones, snatched his
OL,8,F#17,000 watch and tried to steal a
OL,9,FBridgerton star's phone has been jailed
OL,10,Fagain after admitting another two armed
OL,11,FRolex robberies.
OL,13,FZacariah Boulares, 19, ambushed Songs
OL,14,FOf Praise star Jones in Chiswick High
OL,15,FRoad in July 2023.
OL,17,FHe was sent to youth detention, was
OL,18,Freleased, and then jailed last year for
OL,19,Fa string of thefts including trying to
OL,20,Fsteal Bridgerton actress Genevieve
OL,21,FChenneour's mobile phone on Kensington
OL,22,FHigh Street.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
