OL,3,GNEWSATeen jailed again for
OL,4,Amachete-point Rolex robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Southwark Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,7,FBoulares was sentenced to two years and
OL,8,F10 months imprisonment for arming
OL,9,Fhimself with a machete to commit two
OL,10,Fmore robberies in August 2023.
